 glue to attach objects to each other</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/021c663ec21912e7ecb6226be02d7120.poster.avif?t=1765533222\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/021c663ec21912e7ecb6226be02d7120.webm?t=1765533222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/021c663ec21912e7ecb6226be02d7120.mp4?t=1765533222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything works with everything: <strong>find YOUR creative solutions!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/6ebd1108ddb3064923af186047fd975b.avif?t=1765533222\" width=512 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/ac29cc6cbbea9afe31e6a94939eb3a96.avif?t=1765533222\" width=975 height=736 /></span>In 20XX, a massive asteroid hurtles toward Earth, only to stop at the last moment, hovering above the planet. Within its core lies a wealth of rare materials, sparking a global mining operation that has been extracting resources for 25 years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You play as Gustav, a seasoned worker selected for a high-stakes mission</strong>. A strange signal emanates from deep within the asteroid, and a team is sent to investigate. But as you descend into the heart of the asteroid, reality begins to warp: time and space bend, and your team vanishes, leaving you alone. With no way to return, your only option is to push forward. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you reach the core and uncover the mystery of the asteroid, or be lost forever in its depths?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/e2f5fec3661530d094649158fe58d4ec.avif?t=1765533222\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras_big/e2f5fec3661530d094649158fe58d4ec.webp?t=1765533222 width=1560 height=870 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/db1dd42da16206a3a76f64c8941a7c5c.avif?t=1765533222\" width=512 height=128 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated maps</strong>: Each run is unique, challenging you to adapt your strategy. Will you rush for the exit, or take the time to gather powerful tools to tackle tougher levels?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ handmade levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ tools</strong> to interact with the environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>???+ narrative vignettes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras/5c2a437d4a14ad501b2b34d25856ad99.avif?t=1765533222\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223370/extras_big/5c2a437d4a14ad501b2b34d25856ad99.webp?t=1765533222 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p>", "short_description": "There's Nothing Underground is a roguelike puzzle adventure